## Security

No accounts, no API keys, no stored balances — payment is a scoped, time-bounded signature, so there is no reusable credential to steal. Private keys never reach BlockRun. Vulnerability reports: security@blockrun.ai

Page: https://blockrun.ai/security · https://blockrun.ai/.well-known/security.txt

